OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright spells for a while
OL,6,Ffirst thing. However, showers
OL,7,Fspreading across the country as the
OL,8,Fday progresses, some of these being
OL,9,Fheavy with hail and thunder possible.
OL,10,FA cooler northerly breeze developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers reducing in number
OL,13,Fduring the evening but some continuing
OL,14,Fovernight, chiefly around western
OL,15,Fcoasts where they could still be heavy
OL,16,Fand thundery. A cool night with clear
OL,17,Fspells elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
